meta {
  name: scan-share
  seq: 8
}

docs {
  Scan and Share (SHARE_PATIENT_PROFILE_701).
  The gateway posts the shared profile to the bridge URL. The plug answers 202,
  assigns a token number, and sends `m1-on-share-acknowledgement` to the gateway.
  The front desk reads the inbox with the Care permission `can_create_patient`.
}
